@startuml
title P2 Streamed User Audio Tracks - Component Boundaries

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Pulsar App\nor Telegram Adapter" as Sender

package "Coordinator" {
  component "SubmitMedia(audio_track)" as SubmitMedia
  component "Variant Pipeline\n(selected by P2-CODEC)" as VariantPipeline
  database "Media Store\nmedia_items + stream_variants" as MediaStore
  component "Range API\nRange + auth + revocation" as RangeAPI
  component "Transmission API\nqueue/replace + target snapshot" as TransmissionAPI
  component "Main Program Scheduler\nbuffer-ready barrier" as Scheduler
  component "Playback State\nqueue + progress + receipts" as PlaybackState
}

package "Pulsar Node" {
  component "Track Cache\nbounded disk" as TrackCache
  component "Incremental Decoder\nbounded memory" as Decoder
  component "Track Player\npause/seek/resume" as TrackPlayer
  component "Audio Engine" as AudioEngine
  component "Spotify Adapter" as SpotifyAdapter
}

Sender --> SubmitMedia : upload / submit
SubmitMedia --> VariantPipeline : validate + transcode
VariantPipeline --> MediaStore : store canonical variants

Sender --> TransmissionAPI : queue / replace
TransmissionAPI --> PlaybackState : transmission + target state
TransmissionAPI --> Scheduler : start track delivery
Scheduler --> RangeAPI : authorize variant fetch
Scheduler --> PlaybackState : ready / playing / ended

RangeAPI --> MediaStore : resolve variant + ACL
TrackCache --> RangeAPI : HTTP Range GET
TrackCache --> Decoder : compressed bytes
Decoder --> TrackPlayer : PCM pages
TrackPlayer --> AudioEngine : scheduled playback
TrackPlayer --> Scheduler : ready / seek-ready / ended

SpotifyAdapter --> TrackPlayer : interrupt/resume coexistence
PlaybackState --> Sender : metadata / progress / receipts

note right of VariantPipeline
P2-CODEC selects the variant matrix,
decoder contract and cache limits
before production integration.
end note

note bottom of PlaybackState
P2 explicit targets / inbox owns the
final ACL snapshot and offline replay policy.
P2 Air owns 2..N membership routing.
end note

@enduml
